                "content": {
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "**Before importing** replace `__REPLACE_WITH_LOG_ANALYTICS_WORKSPACE_RESOURCE_ID__` with your workspace's full Azure resource ID throughout this file.\n\n- Some signals require recent D365 F&O builds and must be enabled in **Monitoring and Telemetry parameters**.\n- This dashboard uses a **rolling 48-hour lookback**. Use the workbook for an exact 1–2 PM incident window.\n- If the workspace contains other applications, filter these queries by the UAT Application Insights `_ResourceId` before sharing the dashboard.\n- Import does not enable telemetry, create workspaces, or set retention/caps.",
                    "title": "Setup & interpretation",
                    "subtitle": "Read before production use",
                    "markdownUri": null
                  }
                }
              }
            }
